      <activity id="9ca29f8d-1a73-5ece-912a-9b7c0617477f" activityNameId="c7004355-eab9-53be-ac55-a23f18134c8f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Packing, cement</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Packing, cement
The packing and loading process is normalized with an annual production volume of 1'500'000 kg/a. The estimated lifespan of the machines is 25 years.;
UUID: c9043a1f-90d8-3b44-9495-70a9b89a9ce7
Includes the process of packing, transportation within the plant and loading of the bags on paletts. The machines for these processes are taken into account. The waste treatment after use by the end-user and transports of the packing materials are included. Energy demand not included as it is included in the different concrete types.
Location: Data are from one company (packing, lime products) in Switzerland, adapted for cement.
Technology: Assumption: same process as for packing of lime products
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Measured data of one Swiss plant for packing of lime products 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c9043a1f-90d8-3b44-9495-70a9b89a9ce7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
